Runic Artifex
A focused desktop editor for Runic Translations workspaces{{LocalizedSummaries}}
Runic Translations Editor edits the translations of a Runic Translations workspace: the MF2 and RMF2 messages of each language beside their source, with placeholders, plural forms and markup, a live preview, the review state of every translation, and XLIFF export and import. It saves through the same compiler that builds the application, so what it saves is valid.
The editor works offline. It sends nothing over the network and does not update itself.
{{Homepage}} https://github.com/Runic-Artifex/runic-translations-sdk/issues {{ApplicationId}}.desktop
